    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9290" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνόρϝῡμι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όρσω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rouse, stir up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὰ μὲν φόρμιγγ᾽, ἀνὰ δ᾽ αὐλὸν
					ὄρσομεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					9.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1352
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἂν δ᾽ ἄρα Τυδεΐδης
			ὦρτο</span> (
				Ep.
			
			aor.) <i>up he started,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.812
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὰ δ᾽ ὤρνυτ᾽ Ἰήσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					1.349
				</span></i>
			.</div>
